---
name: team-review
description: Test team review with explicit roles and outcomes.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [lead, alpha, beta, reviewer]
---
"""
Collect two independent submissions before review.
"""
contract @4h mentions 3 => expired

"""
You are the lead. State the goal once, then wait for both submissions and the reviewer's
approval.
"""
role lead

"""
You are Alpha. Work on the goal on your own, without copying Beta, and submit within ten minutes.
"""
role alpha

"""
You are Beta. Work on the goal on your own, without copying Alpha, and submit within ten minutes.
"""
role beta

"""
You are the reviewer. Wait for both submissions, compare them against the goal, and approve
within two minutes.
"""
role reviewer

"""
The goal for both members, with what a good submission must contain.
"""
type start
  goal: text(bytes: 1..9600, graphemes: 1..600)

"""
Your submission for the goal: the artifact itself or a reference to it.
"""
type submit
  artifact: text(bytes: 1..9600, graphemes: 1..600)

"""
Approve both submissions.
"""
type approve

"""
The lead has not stated the goal yet. Send start to both members and the reviewer.
"""
state new
  lead -> {alpha,beta,reviewer}: start() => collecting

"""
Alpha and Beta each owe one submission within ten minutes. Review starts when both have arrived.
"""
state collecting
  {alpha,beta} -> {lead,reviewer}: submit() each @10m => reviewing | stalled

"""
Both submissions are in. The reviewer owes an approval within two minutes.
"""
state reviewing
  reviewer -> {lead,alpha,beta}: approve() @2m => complete | stalled

"""
The reviewer approved both submissions. Send nothing more.
"""
end complete

"""
A submission or the approval did not arrive in time. Stop, and report what is missing to the
lead.
"""
end stalled

"""
The four-hour contract clock ran out. Send nothing more.
"""
end expired
